draft-vocab-40960.txt

The 40,960 token ids in this file are HyperQwen's shipped MTP draft vocabulary
(prepare/draft_vocab_ids.json) from https://github.com/syv-ai/HyperQwen
(commit 1cf8665), Copyright the HyperQwen authors, licensed under the
Apache License 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Modification: converted from JSON to llama.cpp's draft-vocab map format
(header line "llama-mtp-vocab-v1 248320 40960", then one token id per line).
The ids and their order are unchanged.

Per HyperQwen, the list was counted over Danish web text (fineweb-2), English
Wikipedia, Python source and the model's own chat outputs (8.8M tokens), with
95% held-out coverage.
